BIS:WS_CBPOL(1.0),M,JP,2024-01,-0.1,368,0,,"From 24 Sep 2026: the BOJ encourages the uncollateralized overnight call rate to remain at around 1.25 percent; From 17 Jun 2026 to 23 Sep 2026: the BOJ encourages the uncollateralized overnight call rate to remain at around 1.00 percent; From 22 Dec 2025 to 16 Jun 2026: the BOJ encourages the uncollateralized overnight call rate to remain at around 0.75 percent; From 27 Jan 2025 to 21 Dec 2025: the BOJ encourages the uncollateralized overnight call rate to remain at around 0.50 percent; From 1 Aug 2024 to 26 Jan 2025: the BOJ encouraged the UOCR to remain at around 0.25% ; From 21 Mar 2024 to 31 July: the BOJ encouraged the UOCR to remain at around 0 to 0.1 %; from 21 Sep 2016 to 20 Mar 2024: the BOJ set the guideline for market operations which specifies a short-term policy interest rate at minus 0.1% and a target level of 10-year JGB yields at around 0%. Short-term policy interest rate; from 4 Apr 2013 to 20 Sep 2016: no policy rate; from 5 Oct 2010 to 3 Apr 2013: the BOJ encouraged the UOCR to remain at around 0 to 0.1%; from 19 Dec 2008 to 4 Oct 2010: the BOJ encouraged the UOCR to remain at around 0. %; from 31 Oct 2008 to 18 Dec 2008: the BOJ encouraged the UOCR to remain at around 0.3%; before 30 Oct 2008, refer to https://data.bis.org/topics/CBPOL",4,Bank of Japan,For details see: http://www.bis.org/statistics/cbpol/cbpol_doc.pdf  ; https://www.boj.or.jp/en/mopo/mpmdeci/mpr_1998/k980909c.htm ; https://www.boj.or.jp/en/mopo/mpmdeci/mpr_1999/k990212c.htm ; https://www.boj.or.jp/en/mopo/mpmdeci/mpr_2000/k000811.htm ; https://www.boj.or.jp/en/mopo/mpmdeci/mpr_2001/k010228a.htm ; https://www.boj.or.jp/en/mopo/mpmdeci/mpr_2006/k060309.htm ; https://www.boj.or.jp/en/mopo/mpmdeci/mpr_2006/k060714.pdf ; https://www.boj.or.jp/en/mopo/mpmdeci/mpr_2007/k070221.pdf ; https://www.boj.or.jp/en/mopo/mpmdeci/mpr_2008/k081031.pdf ; https://www.boj.or.jp/en/mopo/mpmdeci/mpr_2008/k081219.pdf ; https://www.boj.or.jp/en/mopo/mpmdeci/mp